    "created_at": "2019-05-10T17:42:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-05-10T17:42:37Z",
    "body": "Re: declaring feature policy within HTML markup -- the one strong call we've had for this is for Client Hints. See @yoavweiss's and @eeeps's comments [here](https://github.com/w3c/webappsec-feature-policy/issues/55#issuecomment-405185631). I'm not sure how late we can possibly defer the agent cluster allocation, by the time we're pre-scanning the document, can we still make that decision?",
