    "updated_at": "2020-02-11T15:50:27Z",
    "body": "We've pivoted a bit on this feature and are looking for it to be an iframe attribute instead. This causes a nested browsing context group to be created at the iframe itself and then causes all further nested browsing context groups to be in different agents and then they can't possibly share data only via 'postMessage'",
